Exploratory. On another public story (Paranoia, Finn et al. 2018; 22 listeners, outside TRIBE v2's training and evaluation sets), listeners' language areas followed TRIBE's forecast more closely in the 7 minutes it ranked highest than in the 7 minutes it ranked lowest (17 of 22 listeners, one-sided p = 0.0004). Ranking the same minutes by word rate alone: 8 of 22, p = 0.94.
